Fonts bundled with fastemu-gfx
==============================

FastEmu draws the text of MIDP games with these fonts, compiled into the
fastemu-gfx library. They are the DejaVu LGC fonts, version 2.37, the
variant of the DejaVu fonts that covers the Latin, Greek and Cyrillic
scripts. The files are unmodified copies from the release archive
dejavu-lgc-fonts-ttf-2.37.zip published by the DejaVu fonts team at
https://github.com/dejavu-fonts/dejavu-fonts/releases/tag/version_2_37

  DejaVuLGCSans.ttf           SYSTEM and PROPORTIONAL faces, regular
  DejaVuLGCSans-Bold.ttf      SYSTEM and PROPORTIONAL faces, bold
  DejaVuLGCSansMono.ttf       MONOSPACE face, regular
  DejaVuLGCSansMono-Bold.ttf  MONOSPACE face, bold

The DejaVu fonts are based on the Bitstream Vera fonts. The fonts are
